# NOTE: unlike the standard .dockerignore, this legacy build DELIBERATELY includes
# configs/staticRecords/* in the build context. update-legacy.sh generates those
# files from a copy of the live instance's database (real, per-instance row IDs)
# and this Dockerfile.legacy skips the deterministic scaffold step, so the
# generated configs must reach the image. See scripts/update/update-legacy.sh.
